[{"title":"刘主静学士题墨梅见寄因次其韵以复四首 其二","author":"倪谦","text":"一斥投边裔，寒肌瘦似梅。\n下帘秋院里，犹想共抡魁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40682,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘主静学士题墨梅见寄因次其韵以复四首 其三","author":"倪谦","text":"咄咄坐终日，何心复赋梅。\n惟应学弓马，塞上缚渠魁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40683,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘主静学士题墨梅见寄因次其韵以复四首 其四","author":"倪谦","text":"蓬莱春日暖，金鼎待盐梅。\n早践台衡地，调元酌斗魁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40684,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留别卢大海","author":"倪谦","text":"同居泮水采香芹，契合金兰独有君。\n只恐一帆江浦上，离襟愁对夕阳分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40685,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋雨有怀卢大海","author":"倪谦","text":"秋雨萧骚思不禁，小窗无寐拥寒衾。\n只愁静院空阶里，滴碎相知鲍子心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40686,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"聚禽图","author":"倪谦","text":"花容相映鸟相呼，无限春光在画图。\n可爱争栖傍修竹，不知谁是凤凰雏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40687,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"倪谦","text":"谁向山中友鹿群，书声清夜隔溪闻。\n石田茆屋如堪借，我欲来耕陇上云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40688,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墨竹推篷图","author":"倪谦","text":"倚风争舞翠云翘，半启篷窗酒晕消。\n薄暮欲投湘浦宿，隔江谁弄紫鸾箫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40689,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹","author":"倪谦","text":"露叶凝香翠欲流，月华凉浸一庭秋。\n恍疑阿母停鸾驭，玉节玄旌散不收。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40690,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小景为冯副使赋","author":"倪谦","text":"春山春水足追游，满目韶华兴未休。\n说与苍头多载酒，景逢佳处即停舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40691,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄赵永祥杨景通","author":"倪谦","text":"退朝两袖带天香，时复凝思入故乡。\n白屋近来曾到否，素轩修竹长应长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40692,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵状元梅","author":"倪谦","text":"暗度寒香散碧虚，百花头上喷骊珠。\n看图却忆胪传罢，醉促前诃过紫衢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40693,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莲塘水阁画","author":"倪谦","text":"曲曲阑干面面风，危楼半堕水晶宫。\n清香何处浓薰酒，一色芙蓉十里红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40694,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"生子报内叔","author":"倪谦","text":"画楼日暖鹊声乾，俄见深闺已报安。\n偏喜呱呱供一笑，朝回频揭绣帘看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40695,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月梅","author":"倪谦","text":"兔魄移从海上来，玉龙水底误疑猜。\n夜深鳞甲惊飞动，万颗骊珠脱蚌胎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40696,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿萱堂为陈用文赋","author":"倪谦","text":"花前舞袖膝前歌，酌酒看花笑语和。\n但愿忧忘春不老，花开常近北堂多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40697,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怡亲堂四时诗为临川程潜麟赋 其一","author":"倪谦","text":"深深帘幕护香云，脸晕丹霞酒半醺。\n试学儿啼供燕喜，春风笑语隔花闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40698,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怡亲堂四时诗为临川程潜麟赋 其二","author":"倪谦","text":"白纻新裁换越罗，仙郎能舞又能歌。\n晚来侍寝频挥扇，但觉凉生枕簟多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40699,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怡亲堂四时诗为临川程潜麟赋 其三","author":"倪谦","text":"堂上筵开晚未收，霜柑初破洞庭秋。\n婉容膝下承颜色，不借萱花为解忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40700,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怡亲堂四时诗为临川程潜麟赋 其四","author":"倪谦","text":"冰下寒鱼入馔鲜，红炉画阁火频然。\n灵椿不改青青操，自是春秋过八千。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40701,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画梅","author":"倪谦","text":"紫毫唤醒老梅魂，人在孤山月下村。\n从此春风消不得，玉容犹带雪霜痕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40702,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖图","author":"倪谦","text":"湖上岚光紫翠浓，高低台阁画檐重。\n乡山满眼不能到，何日归看九里松。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40703,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题风烟雪月四梅 其一","author":"倪谦","text":"想见冰姿照素袍，数声横笛汉江皋。\n如今不逐春风落，凭仗中山紫兔毫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40704,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题风烟雪月四梅 其二","author":"倪谦","text":"一笑群仙齿粲然，霏霏玉骨锁寒烟。\n蹇驴踏雪曾相遇，流水断桥山店边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40705,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题风烟雪月四梅 其三","author":"倪谦","text":"东君私许冠群芳，万斛明珠夜有光。\n朔雪纷纷莫相妒，六花争似五花香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40706,"sha256":"0e5de