10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题夏仲昭墨竹","author":"倪谦","text":"云锁秦楼凤不归，凭谁重把玉箫吹。\n太常游戏容台上，翠羽分明拂砚池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40744,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"红梅","author":"倪谦","text":"仙子朝元下石坛，却留丹灶付云看。\n玉虬偷得三千颗，瘦骨清癯耐岁寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40745,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"捕鱼图","author":"倪谦","text":"双飞紫燕掠春波，绿渚芳洲次第过。\n试问船船争举网，不知谁个得鱼多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40746,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题奚官调马图","author":"倪谦","text":"不是奚官不敢骑，自缘龙骨世间希。\n琼林宴罢游春陌，应使人誇匹练飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40747,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贡院撤棘黄学士以诗见遗步韵以复 其一","author":"倪谦","text":"命题当避历科同，细检经书启素栊。\n夜半录成分次第，鲁论先得祭于公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40748,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贡院撤棘黄学士以诗见遗步韵以复 其二","author":"倪谦","text":"考校新增八子同，三千文卷集窗栊。\n五经搜阅分诗礼，兼判春秋十二公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40749,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贡院撤棘黄学士以诗见遗步韵以复 其三","author":"倪谦","text":"从知内外久扶同，防范其如限一栊。\n得谤成雠俱不计，已将盟誓付天公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40750,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贡院撤棘黄学士以诗见遗步韵以复 其四","author":"倪谦","text":"共说前科志操同，肯交关节透帘栊。\n飞章交搆徒为尔，美谥玉成文介公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40751,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仲秋丁祭礼成分胙见及因成小诗二绝录奉掌教王先生 其一","author":"倪谦","text":"陪祀成均振佩琚，年年鼎肉馂神馀。\n谁知万死投边裔，亦荷分膰到谪居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40752,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仲秋丁祭礼成分胙见及因成小诗二绝录奉掌教王先生 其二","author":"倪谦","text":"庶品颁来出豆笾，亲尝深仰道如天。\n此心若也含微玷，举箸能无愧圣贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40753,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八月二十日梦与二美人共饮席上各请赋诗余得一绝醒而忘其首句因足成之漫纪于此","author":"倪谦","text":"蝉鬓云鬟逞丽妆，郁金香喷紫罗囊。\n平生未识红鸾字，愿借春纤写数行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40754,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"于景瞻以闺情和予梦中之作少寓热中之意因效颦以复十首 其一","author":"倪谦","text":"几回搦管不成章，空把盐枝插路傍。\n封臂绛纱何日解，菱花一夜恐飞霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40755,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"于景瞻以闺情和予梦中之作少寓热中之意因效颦以复十首 其二","author":"倪谦","text":"又逐残云过女墙，曾陪歌舞在昭阳。\n如今羞见缠头锦，空惜馀音绕画梁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40756,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"于景瞻以闺情和予梦中之作少寓热中之意因效颦以复十首 其三","author":"倪谦","text":"湖山石畔好烧香，银汉无波玉露凉。\n低蹙翠裙深下拜，细将心事诉穹苍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40757,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"于景瞻以闺情和予梦中之作少寓热中之意因效颦以复十首 其四","author":"倪谦","text":"落月流辉照屋梁，又看红日上扶桑。\n若为化作山头石，望见夫君志亦偿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40758,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"于景瞻以闺情和予梦中之作少寓热中之意因效颦以复十首 其五","author":"倪谦","text":"千金不惜买文章，永巷秋深灏气凉。\n若得重瞳亲一顾，含羞谁引驾车羊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40759,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]